// ============================================================================
// Lab checks: quick queries to see whether your set-up is working.
// Run these in: Azure portal > Microsoft Sentinel > your workspace > Logs.
// Do them before you start any case. If one comes back empty, fix that first.
// ============================================================================


// ---- Which tables have any data at all? ------------------------------------
// This is the first thing I ran on a new workspace. Slow, but it tells you what you really have.
search *
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize Events = count() by $table
| order by Events desc


// ---- Is Entra ID sending sign-in and audit logs? ---------------------------
// AuditLogs shows up in a few minutes. SigninLogs can take 30 minutes or more at the start.
union SigninLogs, AuditLogs
| summarize Events = count() by Type


// ---- Are sign-ins reaching the workspace as fast as they happen? -----------
// Compare this with the sign-in log in the Entra portal (Entra ID > Monitoring & health > Sign-in logs).
// If the portal has rows and this doesn't, it is export delay. Wait.
SigninLogs
| project TimeGenerated, UserPrincipalName, ResultType, IPAddress, AppDisplayName
| order by TimeGenerated desc
| take 20


// ---- Is the Windows VM's agent alive? --------------------------------------
Heartbeat
| where Computer has "win-endpoint01"
| summarize Last = max(TimeGenerated), Beats = count() by Category


// ---- Are Windows Security events arriving? ---------------------------------
// Look for 4688 (process creation). If you only see logon events, the audit policy is not on yet.
SecurityEvent
| summarize Events = count(), Latest = max(TimeGenerated) by EventID
| order by Events desc
